    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "An endoscope or long rectal tube can often decompress the loop, and resection and anastomosis may be deferred a few days; "
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       },
       {
        "type": "highlight",
        "attrs": {
         "hex": "FF0000"
        }
       }
      ],
      "text": "without resection, recurrence is almost inevitable"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
